Subject: [PATCH 058/230] Let users pick favorite leagues from the Matchday
 feed
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The league follow list was only reachable inside first-run onboarding, and
following a league changed nothing but the feed's scope — the push producers
only ever read `favorite_teams`, so a followed competition stayed silent.
The feed now carries its own picker chip opening a BottomSheet over the whole
`/api/competitions` catalog (leagues, cups and international tournaments,
followed ones pinned to their section, coming-soon ones inert), and a followed
league now fans its fixtures and goals out to its followers through
`leagueFollowers`, deduped against club follows so one user never gets two
pushes for the same event.

